			"notes": "# Full Intricarpet Rewrite!!\n## Changes:\n- Removed all carpet rules cause there weren't really any useful ones\n- Redid interactions to be much more lag friendly and easy to use\n- Added 2 new interactions: Mob Spawning and Random Ticks\n- Fixed the stupid broken explosion logger that's never worked SMH\n- Fully supports 1.17.1 through 1.19.4"
